category-vehicles = VEHICLES
category-weapons = WEAPONS

## Failures

signed-out = Wand is signed out: open Wand and sign in
not-installed = Wand is not set up on this PC: install it, open it and sign in
probe-failed = the connection check to Wand also failed. Check your connection, VPN or proxy settings
probe-ok = the connection check to Wand passed, but the API request failed for an unknown reason
proxy-missing = Wand's folder has no GameLauncher.exe, update Wand or set its current folder
proxy-failed = could not prepare the game to start without its anti-cheat
proxy-restart = the game's anti-cheat is running: close the game and start it with the trainer
service-silent = Wand's service did not answer, update Wand or set its current folder
activate-unsupported = this trainer needs Wand's own way of loading it, which is not supported yet
trainer-file-missing = the trainer file was not found (404): open the game again or run the trainer once in Wand
